# Leave DATABASE_URL unset for local development: an embedded PGlite database
# is created under ./.data automatically.
#
# Production (Vercel + Neon): set DATABASE_URL in the Vercel project settings, for
# both the Production and Preview environments. Use Neon's *pooled* connection
# string (the host contains "-pooler"), because every serverless function opens
# its own connections. It looks like:
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@ep-xxx-pooler.eu-central-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# Canonical origin of the site (defaults to https://lahga.fyi in nuxt.config.ts).
# NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://lahga.fyi
